{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "012yus_403_2_4_012_03_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a4bd36cfd8562ebf3e455291ccc6526e77253cf35d0f5047a5effb2ebdcc764b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:012yus_403_2_4_012_03_09_a:2_4_012_03_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24124bf3ee7ce853e021236929e36b2644a2556971c378ad555344ce60ea6d61",
      "text": "监督，辛苦啦！\n我有个小小的请求。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_403_2_4_012_03_09_a:2_4_012_03_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6bb96c64e27271abdfd97bde4c3e9b4d51e1a3abe64f3587d4563bd863e25e9",
      "text": "明天路上移动的时候，\n会一起经过那家百货商场附近对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_403_2_4_012_03_09_a:2_4_012_03_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fba9761859f7e9d00ca35f4bf00a0a952045d1c16b8e98ade2666aacac026cb8",
      "text": "难得有机会，我想在广告前拍张照。\n监督，能帮我拍一张吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_403_2_4_012_03_09_a:2_4_012_03_09_a:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59c55d4b878df63d50ff372587f8319ae3821c1cf3fe8c6bce31cf184b4a7c34",
      "text": "没问题！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_403_2_4_012_03_09_a:2_4_012_03_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c0191562713a11ed7cb58e6b9ca8b58cdeacccae0938a5ecbd5cf4a39a8d1ca",
      "text": "太棒了！我听说在粉丝大家之间，\n很流行和那张海报合影呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_403_2_4_012_03_09_a:2_4_012_03_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a905bd8d9b8e6737f2389e797cf33ba4f84e5c8a25f3a42f7ff88c44e33fbed",
      "text": "趁着广告还在展出，我也想着\n照样拍一张试试看呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_403_2_4_012_03_09_a:2_4_012_03_09_a:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38b7c69ef7d6d32d4d19733bc39c534181c0eeaf8acfd71bd655ddd65f1de900",
      "text": "多亏了这份工作，今年的情人节\n就像大家一起享受的节日一样，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_403_2_4_012_03_09_a:2_4_012_03_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb62377d5a75d766458d43e02a2f5aea6de5c8a14924f888d96f93d9d6abbec4",
      "text": "宣传活动马上就要结束了，\n虽然稍微有点舍不得……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_403_2_4_012_03_09_a:2_4_012_03_09_a:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c5e150bba7114c88e59ee0f07688c53e78e38c48537ffdcd9daae6edabe520c",
      "text": "但留下了很多回忆，超级开心！百货商场的\n客人们也能感到高兴真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_403_2_4_012_03_09_a:2_4_012_03_09_a:cmd-000025:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffb0225729db659af805cf2c6526750a865681d64dc590f3e885c5e174928ab8",
      "text": "明年的情人节\n也很让人期待呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_403_2_4_012_03_09_a:2_4_012_03_09_a:cmd-000026:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27035c20d11deb020717ae9535385bd681658b358b318e96fd3694d7f5a8ffe3",
      "text": "度过了一个美好的\n情人节呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_403_2_4_012_03_09_a:2_4_012_03_09_a:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b0cadf306860adc222190a8c00296065e1f4abafb2a3045d68fa7b9af440da1",
      "text": "是啊。我还想在那家百货商场买巧克力，\n也想在工作上继续有合作！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_403_2_4_012_03_09_a:2_4_012_03_09_a:cmd-000033:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a95aaa087e608399a7a45c5fb91467f6347fa84fd27e9440282bf2084b86c480",
      "text": "嗯！累了的时候就吃点甜甜的巧克力，\n明天开始的工作我也会加油的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_403_2_4_012_03_09_a:2_4_012_03_09_a:cmd-000037:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55911c6354e11a7cce4486243ff05c80f858cee7b121cf534b8963916d1d6d91",
      "text": "……啊，差不多到晚饭时间了。不好意思监督，\n我先挂啦。那就明天见！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
